{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BcQ8gPRFejV7MOMtml_BUQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:01.930514+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/BcQ8gPRFejV7MOMtml_BUQ","html":"<div><section><section><section>。。<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iadNpowLvRQv996k81h7ibMATyoH4bj3ExN0ibH6qKZ1hGIMqUDY5sjeSSTcic6SbkCQDo2NTM5YgBEkxHr7I4mFicQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p>我院金融硕士项目、国际商务硕士双学位项目、数据科学与商务分析硕士项目即日起开启招生，在这篇推文中你可以看到：</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>1. 各专业硕士项目的简要介绍</strong>（最新版本介绍，请静候后续将发布的分项目深度介绍）</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>2. 入读管院可享有哪些资源</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>3. 上海场及北京场宣讲会安排</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>4. “领创营<strong>”</strong>及“智科营<strong>”</strong>具体安排和申请方式</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>5. 奖学金设置</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>6. 联系我们的方式</strong></p><p><strong><br/></strong></p><p>继续阅读了解上述内容详情，关注学术升学方向的同学请留意，<strong>硕博连读项目招生及博思营入营时间拟定为5-8月，具体招生公告将于3月另行发布</strong>。</p><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><strong>复旦管院专业硕士项目简介</strong></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>我院专硕硕士有以下三个项目，各项目介绍可按提示点击直达，<span><strong>请注意近期我们将发布项目全新介绍</strong></span>，请对我们保持关注。</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>金融硕士项目（</strong><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI4NjQ2MDQ0Nw==&amp;mid=2247504915&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=95e042cfb28e930841ed7b0a086d4ac4&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><strong>点这里查看详情</strong></span></a><strong>）</strong></p><p>◆金融-国际金融方向，MIF（与加州大学洛杉矶分校安德森商学院，即UCLA Anderson School课程合作）</p><p>◆金融-量化金融与金融工程方向，MQFFE（与普林斯顿大学，即Princeton University顶尖师资合作）</p><p>◆金融-全球化金融管理方向，GMIF（与伦敦商学院，即London Business School合办双学位）</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>国际商务硕士双学位项目</strong></p><p>◆国际商务-国际管理方向，DDIM（与意大利博科尼大学，即Bocconi，以及意大利路易斯大学，即LUISS合办双学位，<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI4NjQ2MDQ0Nw==&amp;mid=2247505902&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=522c83bdefa82e7d16648c48b835a3fb&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><strong>点这里查看详情</strong></span></a>）</p><p>◆国际商务-全球化经营管理方向，GMiM（与伦敦商学院，即London Business School合办双学位，<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI4NjQ2MDQ0Nw==&amp;mid=2247507108&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=02ebbd6cee7c08899b46554ad1618933&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><strong>点这里查看详情</strong></span></a>）</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>数据科学与商务分析硕士项目</strong></p><p>◆应用统计-数据科学与商务分析，DS&amp;BA（<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI4NjQ2MDQ0Nw==&amp;mid=2247507110&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=611bf124ced9abad57dc9e6b2d3daf53&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><strong>点这里查看详情</strong></span></a>）</p><p><br/></p></section><p>学院四大学科、八大系为各专硕项目提供强力课程支持，各项目之间课程打通、师资共享、实践打通、人脉打通（见下图，可点开放大查看）。</p><p><br/></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tRsJKjZiac5SU5uMj2eW7TEeAiaV2icKkysv4tfynzUY7ay3dv623jJbFspicUmDDodvrzVP9VVdeTE3nrhqLuuCAg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><strong>入读复旦管院可以享有哪些资源？</strong></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tRsJKjZiac5RgQOJj6QlKvN1HCzAuEwE2Hjpiat7Y6Xm3ZL9DAuS2Phrz1pcO44BMMJt7teVgWOypEAib6mZb8ReA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong>强大的专业配置</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>复旦大学管理学院是全球学科设置配置最全的商学院之一，拥有八大系：<strong>金融与财务学系、信息管理与商业智能系、会计学系、统计与数据科学系、市场营销学系、企业管理系、管理科学系、应用经济学系</strong>。</p><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><strong>师资与科研实力突出</strong></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p>学院现有全职教师163人，其中教授61人，副教授63人，讲师39人。学院教师中161人具有博士学位，其中80人取得海外博士学位。</p></section><p><br/></p><p>学院以“管理兴国”为己任，以“科创战略”为指导，扎根中国大地开展管理理论研究与实践创新。2024年UTD最新发布的“2019-2023年全球商学院科研排名百强榜单”中，复旦管院位列全球第70名、继续蝉联中国内地第一，连续九年进入全球百强。泰晤士高等教育(THE)中国学科评级中，学院的工商管理、管理科学与工程、统计学和应用经济学四个一级学科评级均为 A+。</p><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>亚洲领先的就业支持</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>管理学院职业发展中心（CDO）<span>服务于学院所有在读学生，包括本科生、研究生、博士生和MBA学生。通过提供高质量的服务和资源，职业发展中心旨在帮助学生明确职业发展方向，提高就业竞争力。同时，中心也致力于为企业提供多样化的招聘服务，并积极拓展校企合作项目，通过多种渠道加强学生与企业之间的交流与沟通。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>英国《金融时报》（FT）发布的2024年全球MBA项目百强榜单中，复旦MBA项目位列全球第27，管院的职业服务连续三次蝉联亚洲第一，职业成长全球第三。</span></p><p><br/></p><p>了解更多就业方面的信息，可对我们保持持续关注，或查看学院就业中心公众号：</p><p><br/></p><section></section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>紧密结合行业的第二课堂</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>学院第二课堂的实务课程和各项大赛，帮助学生在学习投研理论的基础上，结合市场实践中的经典，提升学习的宽度和研究的深度。</p><p><br/></p><p>第二课堂课程涵盖外资投行、行研、期货、固收、私募、基金、数据科学、奢侈品、文史哲、心理等多个领域，近三年有超过20位新财富最佳分析师来管院做分享。</p><p><br/></p><p>（关于第二课堂的更多信息，请<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI4NjQ2MDQ0Nw==&amp;mid=2247508208&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=737be463af191909e8187bbc85e5b82c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><strong><span>点此</span></strong></span></a>查看）</p><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>活跃在全球各行各业的校友</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>截至2024年12月，我院校友人数已达62,642人，分别毕业于本硕博各专业以及MBA、EMBA、DBA、MPAcc等各项目。</span><span>从五湖四海齐聚到管理学院的校友们毕业后又走向世界各地的各行各业，其中既有行业资深专家、领军人物、高级主管，也有初出茅庐的行业新秀。</span><span>如果想了解更多关于学院校友的信息，可关注：</span></p><p><br/></p><section></section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>世界一流的双院区学习环境</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/tRsJKjZiac5RgQOJj6QlKvN1HCzAuEwE2YNsibCoFucAwvWT1OCG2dN6rJXgZ9AYXSibEK1lENc4teJBiaAic6kEmIA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><br/></p><p>2024年，复旦管院政立院区正式启用。专硕同学将在国顺、政立两个院区学习，同时可以参与两个院区举办的各项活动，并使用优质的硬件设施和学习资源。</p><p><br/></p><section></section><p><br/></p><p>复旦管院政立院区以“面向未来百年”为建设目标，与科技园区、公共社区充分融合，以独特的五“新”定位——思想新策源、文化新地标、社区新生态、建筑新典范、教育新高地，展现了在知识共创、文化共建、建筑共享、社区共融等多方面的全新探索。</p><p><br/></p><p>以上仅为管理学院的部分资源介绍，更多宝藏资源，等待你加入管院之后探索。</p></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><strong>上海场及北京场宣讲会安排</strong></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>上海场</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><strong>2025年2月25日</strong></p><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>北京场</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong>2025年3月1日</strong></p><p><br/></p></section><section><p>具体地点及报名方式请关注我们后续发布的公告。</p><p><br/></p></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong>“领创营<strong>”</strong>及“智科营<strong>”</strong>具体安排和申请方式</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>“领创营”举办时间</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><strong>申请MIF、GMIF、GMiM、DDIM的同学请关注“领创营<strong>”</strong></strong></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tRsJKjZiac5SU5uMj2eW7TEeAiaV2icKkysxicvLLStsYDzTyThmStSxiamuh5iaKjBGVEOJgYOIoxxOiaViaa6SwsLiaMw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>“智科营”举办时间</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><strong>申请MQFFE、DS&amp;BA的同学请关注“智科营<strong>”</strong></strong></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tRsJKjZiac5SU5uMj2eW7TEeAiaV2icKkysOCnRAsFgAHJzyNWGiaNG5ahxoiaibGwJn9rz8UN44SJ7o98Zvzl9RiaETA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><br/></p><p>*请对本公众号保持持续关注，我院将稍后公布“领创营”及“智科营<span>”</span>的具体举办日期和每轮次申请截止时间。</p></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>招生人数</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>2025年各项目计划招生总人数，与上一年度基本保持一致，各项目招生人数根据实际情况进行调节。</p><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>申请资格</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>◆申请“领创营”和“智科营”的申请人应为本科前三年成绩优秀，可确保获得2025年所在院校推荐免试资格的大三学生；</p><p><br/></p><p>◆我院所有项目欢迎理工医科及其他非经管专业的跨专业学生申请，同时各项目均鼓励多元化求职方向；</p><p><br/></p><p>◆金融硕士项目量化金融与金融工程方向、数据科学与商务分析硕士项目需要申请人具备较强的数理基础和编程能力，笔试将统一考核数理和编程。</p><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>◆申请表单（网申系统自动生成，无需操作）；</p><p><br/></p><p>◆证件照、成绩单（含第二学位或专业的成绩单）、英语考试成绩及其他证明文书扫描文档；</p><p><br/></p><p>◆副教授及以上或业界专家推荐信2封，需在系统中输入推荐人的邮箱（请使用推荐人的官方邮箱），系统将自动发送推荐信链接至邮箱。</p><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>申请流程</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>学生申请入营时，原则上需在院系统和校系统同时注册和申请，如在填报我院后有其他申请意向，我院在申请人提交退出申请后可做校系统撤销处理。</p><p><br/></p><p><strong>院系统：</strong></p><p><strong>https://app.fdsm.fudan.edu.cn/admission/application/upec</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>校系统：</strong></p><p><strong>https://gsas.fudan.edu.cn/logon</strong></p><p><br/></p><p>申请我院的2025年度申请人，请按照下图流程（可点击放大查看）完成学院和学校系统的网上系统报名，无需邮寄任何纸质材料。</p><p><br/></p><p><em>*校系统目前暂未开放，开放时间以复旦大学研究生院通知为准。</em></p><section><p><br/></p></section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tRsJKjZiac5SU5uMj2eW7TEeAiaV2icKkys5mA6ZlB58CpQMcwSBia4TxRbGuxOPK1r4k6aWv3wmttjgjqR5qL8dibw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><section><br/></section></section><section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></section><section><p><strong><span>特别注意</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>1. </span></strong>2025年，我院仍接受<span><strong>同时申请任意2个专硕项目</strong></span>，招生组将综合审核并经本人确认后决定最终入营项目；如后期获得两个志愿的预录取资格，则由申请人与招生组沟通决定最终录取项目；可同时申请GMIM和GMIF项目，但一旦以其中一个志愿入营则失去另一个志愿的入营/录取机会。</p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span>2. </span></strong>存在<strong><span>第一志愿获待定、但后期以第二志愿直接或经二次入营获得录取的可能</span></strong>，具体将视各项目申请人整体状况而定。</p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span>3. </span></strong> “领创营”和“智科营”入营前将<strong><span>新增AI考察环节</span></strong>，3月和4月“领创营”AI考察成绩仅计入最终总分，其余轮次AI考察成绩将计入入营总分及最终总分。</p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span>4. </span></strong>复旦大学管理学院将为营员提供“领创营”和“智科营”期间<strong><span>部分正餐</span></strong>，营员需<strong><span>自行解决交通和住宿</span></strong>。</p><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>审核录取</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>“领创营”和“智科营”入营及最终录取结果将以E-mail和电话形式直接通知学生本人。所有通知将优先通过E-mail发送，请务必确保电子邮箱的地址正确和有效，并做到及时查收<strong><span>（注：请不要使用qq、hotmail、outlook和icloud邮箱）</span></strong>。</p><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>奖学金设置</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>2026级专硕项目学费和奖学金设置拟<strong><span>与过去四年保持一致</span></strong>。</p><p><br/></p><p>（参考：2024年学费奖学金信息</p><p>https://www.fdsm.fudan.edu.cn/upec/upec1556954633068）</p><p><br/></p><p><em>注：所有项目第一学年奖学金将根据“领创营”和“智科营”综合表现而定，第二学年奖学金将根据第一学年成绩以及社会服务表现综合评定。</em></p><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>联系我们</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong>复旦大学管理学院本硕博教育中心</strong></p><p>专硕项目咨询：021-25011531、25011530、25011485</p><p>硕博项目咨询：021-<span>25011564、</span>25011497</p><p>邮箱：upec@fudan.edu.cn</p><p>官网：www.fdsm.fudan.edu.cn/upec</p><p>微信：fdsm-upec “复旦管院本硕博教育中心”</p><p>小红书：复旦管院UPEC</p></section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p>请各位同学对我们保持持续关注，我们将在近期发布宣讲会信息、“领创营”及“智科营”详细信息、在读学生及校友专访等内容。</p><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/5vggh3Ik5QRW0DMk6pqheiajoEvOga0xTQkdnvfMhNdPhu18GjOxqTSKibLBhunvxiadhHLRoyKHWZOA7GBKcA3tg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"0d882824acd4b44733fa49204109b9eb34e6cd695ecd291e055ebdfc5fc5c138","textLength":3536,"sourceSha256":"fc2c01189ae25754406d2c8876360c746517813d307175c9b9d283f48bc9081d","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4c85d9188cbdfb5519b1","title":"2025年复旦大学管理学院2026级专业硕士项目推免招生正式启动！","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:01.930514+00:00"}
